<http://data.silknow.org/object/a2bcb78e-d189-3315-acf9-cededd6cb69a/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/general-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Linen canvas ground, embroidered with silver and polychrome silk yarns in stem and tent stitches.  On a silver ground, a large, virtually symmetrical plant bearing a variety of blossoms and leaves.  A pair of snails on side stalks of plant; scattered over background are flies and caterpillars.  Narrow borders top and bottom showing alternate white and shaded blue chevrons.  Silver tarnished; silks faded.  Narrow black frame; glazed."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/a2bcb78e-d189-3315-acf9-cededd6cb69a> .

